#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![15-qubit GHZ state](/docs/images/guides/transpiler-"
"stages/transpiler-11.avif \"15-qubit GHZ state before transpilation\")\n"
msgstr ""
"![State GHZ 15 qubit](/docs/images/guides/transpiler-"
"stages/transpiler-11.avif \"State GHZ 15 qubit sebelum transpilasi\")\n"

