"The following code constructs a 15-qubit GHZ state and compares the "
"`optimization_levels` of transpilation in terms of resulting circuit depth, "
"gate counts, and multi-qubit gate counts.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kode berikut membangun state GHZ 15 qubit dan membandingkan "
"`optimization_levels` transpilasi dari segi kedalaman Circuit hasil, jumlah "
"Gate, dan jumlah Gate multi-Qubit.\n"

